disco (0.11.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fixed: the Builder page crashed when its step buttons were pressed
    ('int' object is not callable). Pages get nav_step and nav_section.
  * The Builder page and the Quick Wizard are removed: Welcome (about,
    donation, show at start), then Start (extract an ISO or continue a
    project, internet check), then eleven steps with Back, Next and Finish.
  * New Startup step: services and programs after login, on or off with a
    tick (systemd, SysVinit, OpenRC, runit, XDG autostart).
  * New Files page: folders that belong to the user (no root needed) and the
    system edited as administrator.
  * Easy Wallpaper & Logo: choose a picture, set as default, apply (also for
    the logo, login screen, boot menus and picture of new users).
  * Popular applications with tick boxes; SD-card images from the Build page.
  * New logo with a penguin tinkering with a computer.
  * A test presses every button of every page and runs the work behind it.
  * US English everywhere; docs/QUICKSTART.md replaces docs/PANDUAN.md.
  * Fixes from two code reviews: typed text survives page refreshes; the
    installer choice changes the system; SD-card accounts with the default
    password log in over SSH with a key only; /etc/skel imports leave
    secrets behind; presets cannot inject lines into scripts or sources;
    live-build failures are reported; package lists are checked before
    they replace; unlocked Chromium settings are recommended; links never
    lead writes out of the image; the README PDF text has its real size.

