distroforge (1:0.9.0~beta) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First beta, on the way to 1.0. The epoch keeps upgrades from 0.17 Alpha
    working (0.9 sorts before 0.17 without it).
  * Boot Loader tab: install or remove GRUB 2, GRUB with Secure Boot,
    systemd-boot, rEFInd, EFISTUB and Syslinux/EXTLINUX in the image, choose
    the one the installer uses and set each one up. EFISTUB and Syslinux are
    installed by an own Calamares step (shellprocess@distroforge-bootloader)
    that falls back to a boot loader that works on the computer, GRUB last.
  * Menus merged: 13 steps.
  * After a build, everything but the ISO can be deleted.
  * Send feedback: bugs, errors, ideas and questions with files attached.
  * New slate and blue colors.
  * Fixed: opening links and the user guide failed with "No such file or
    directory: 'runuser'" when started through pkexec.
  * One user guide, in English.

