distroforge (0.17.0~alpha) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New name: DistroForge (was Eduka-Customizer). The package replaces
    eduka-customizer; the old commands and settings keep working.
  * Check & Build: fix problems automatically or by hand; GRUB that Debian
    live ISOs install from their pool is no longer reported as missing.
  * Review & Apply: changes wait in one list, are checked one by one and
    applied together.
  * ISO size targets (100 MB to 4.4 GB, or smallest) with lossless
    compression and safe size savers.
  * About page: licenses of every component, trademarks, credits,
    donations; PDF user guides in Indonesian and English.
  * Clearer texts on every page and in the command line help.

