eduka-customizer (0.14.0~alpha) unstable; urgency=medium

  * "What is your distribution for?" (Education, Server, Professional, Home,
    Other) with recommendations that can be unticked or closed.
  * Package browser with every package of the Debian sources, search,
    tick boxes, and removal of the applications of the ISO; also in the
    Quick Wizard.
  * Add themes, icons, cursors, fonts, wallpapers, Plymouth and SDDM themes
    by drag and drop (files, folders, archives); wallpaper gallery with one
    default.
